        <name>generate_uuid_v4</name>
        <qualifiedname>utils::generate_uuid_v4</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Generate a random UUID v4 string. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses a thread-local Mersenne-Twister seeded from std::random_device so that IDs are unique across threads without lock contention.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>Lowercase UUID v4 string of the form &quot;xxxxxxxx-xxxx-4xxx-yxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx&quot;. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
